    "output_token_ids_sha256": "14770eb7796740fa798149c2debd8d690dfccf4a87ef2c6578bea817dd87417c",
    "raw_output": "```rust\npub fn idempotency_batch_trace(keys: &[String], amounts: &[i32]) -> Option<Vec<i32>> {\n    if keys.is_empty() {\n        return Some(vec![]);\n    }\n\n    let mut result: Vec<i32> = Vec::new();\n    let mut seen_keys: std::collections::HashSet<String> = std::collections::HashSet::new();\n\n    for (i, (key, amount)) in keys.iter().zip(amounts.iter()).enumerate() {\n        let key = key.clone();\n        if seen_keys.contains(&key) {\n            // Key already seen, add the new amount to the cumulative total\n            result.push(amount);\n        } else {\n            // First time seeing this key, add the amount to the cumulative total\n            result.push(amount);\n            seen_keys.insert(key);\n        }\n    }\n\n    Some(result)\n}\n```<|im_end|>",
